    "You said the goal is to pack all the goods — does that mean every available unit of every type (all 120 A, 90 B, 300 C, 90 D, 120 E) must be loaded into containers, or are the available quantities just upper limits and it is acceptable to leave some goods unpacked?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding whether the available quantities are mandatory minimums to be fully packed or optional upper limits."
}

